---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { site, emailLink, url } from '../lib/site';
---

<Layout
  title="Let’s talk"
  description="Start a conversation with Alphpaca about your software project, technical challenges, Atlas Cloud, or Eduroo. Contact hello@alphpaca.io."
>
  <section class="container page-hero">
    <span class="eyebrow">
      Get in touch / Good things start with a conversation
    </span>
    <h1>
      What are you
      <br />
      <span class="gold-text">working on?</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="hero-description">
      An idea worth exploring, a product that needs its next chapter, or a
      problem you’re trying to untangle. Tell us a little about it.
    </p>
  </section>
  <section class="container contact-grid">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">Direct is good</span>
      <h2>Say hello.</h2>
      <a class="contact-email" href={emailLink()}>
        {site.email}
      </a>
      <p class="contact-note">
        A short introduction is enough. Tell us what you want to achieve, where
        things stand, and any timing or budget constraints that would help frame
        the conversation.
      </p>
      <p>
        Interested in Atlas Cloud or Eduroo? We’d also like to hear from
        potential users and collaborators as we develop both platforms.
      </p>
    </div>
    <form class="contact-form" id="contact-form" data-email={site.email}>
      <h3>A little context goes a long way.</h3>
      <p>This prepares an email in your own email app.</p>
      <div class="form-field">
        <label for="name">Your name</label>
        <input
          id="name"
          name="name"
          autocomplete="name"
          required
          maxlength="100"
          placeholder="How should we address you?"
        />
      </div>
      <div class="form-field">
        <label for="interest">What would you like to talk about?</label>
        <select id="interest" name="interest">
          <option value="project">A software project</option>
          <option value="atlas">Atlas Cloud</option>
          <option value="eduroo">Eduroo</option>
          <option value="partnership">A partnership</option>
          <option value="other">Something else</option>
        </select>
      </div>
      <div class="form-field">
        <label for="message">A few words about it</label>
        <textarea
          id="message"
          name="message"
          required
          maxlength="5000"
          placeholder="Your idea, your challenge, or what you have in mind…"
        ></textarea>
      </div>
      <button class="button button-gold" type="submit">
        Prepare an email <span aria-hidden="true">+</span>
      </button>
      <p class="form-help">
        You review and send the email yourself. This site does not submit or
        store your message.{' '}
        <a class="text-link" href={url('privacy/')}>
          Privacy details
        </a>
      </p>
      <p id="form-status" class="form-status" aria-live="polite" hidden></p>
      <noscript>
        <p class="noscript-note">
          To get in touch, email <a href={emailLink()}>{site.email}</a>{' '}
          directly.
        </p>
      </noscript>
    </form>
  </section>
  <section class="container section">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">Before we talk</span>
        <h2>A few useful answers.</h2>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-list">
      <details>
        <summary>Can we start with an early-stage idea?</summary>
        <p>
          Yes. You don’t need a finished brief. A problem, a target audience,
          and a rough idea of the outcome are a useful starting point for
          discussing scope and feasibility.
        </p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Can you help with an existing product?</summary>
        <p>
          Yes. We can discuss ongoing development, integrations, infrastructure,
          or specific reliability and performance challenges. Sharing the
          current situation helps us find the right starting point.
        </p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Are Atlas Cloud and Eduroo available yet?</summary>
        <p>
          Both are in development. There is no public signup or committed launch
          date. Get in touch if you’d like to share your needs or discuss the
          product direction.
        </p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>What should we include in the first message?</summary>
        <p>
          Your goal, the people the product serves, the current stage, and any
          important constraints. If you already have a brief or technical
          context, you can attach it in your email app.
        </p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
<script>
  const form = document.querySelector<HTMLFormElement>('#contact-form');
  const select = document.querySelector<HTMLSelectElement>('#interest');
  const interest = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search).get('interest');
  if (
    select &&
    interest &&
    [...select.options].some((option) => option.value === interest)
  )
    select.value = interest;
  form?.addEventListener('submit', (event) => {
    event.preventDefault();
    if (!form.reportValidity()) return;
    const data = new FormData(form);
    const name = String(data.get('name') || '').trim();
    const message = String(data.get('message') || '').trim();
    const status = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#form-status');
    if (!name || !message) {
      if (status) {
        status.hidden = false;
        status.textContent =
          'Please include your name and a few words about your request.';
      }
      return;
    }
    const topic = select?.selectedOptions[0]?.textContent || 'A conversation';
    const body = `Hi Alphpaca,\n\n${message}\n\nBest,\n${name}`;
    window.location.href = `mailto:${form.dataset.email}?subject=${encodeURIComponent(`${topic} — ${name}`)}&body=${encodeURIComponent(body)}`;
    if (status) {
      status.hidden = false;
      status.textContent = `Your email app should open with a draft. If it doesn’t, email ${form.dataset.email} directly. Your message has not been sent.`;
    }
  });
</script>
